'''Bun Bun Symbiote''' (パラサイトブンブン, ''Parasaito Bun Bun'', '''Parasite Bun Bun''') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Teacher Bun Bun]] first seen as the boss of [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. He was added in [[Version 4.5 Update|Version 4.5]].

